{% comment %}
  Store-wide (not per-product) — a rollup of this store's own real, approved product reviews
  (see app/services/review.server.ts's getPublicStoreReviewSummary) plus currently-earned
  achievement medals, both sourced from app/routes/api.reviews.store.tsx. Not a separate
  "store review" entity — no such concept exists in the schema, and none is introduced here;
  every real review is still tied to a specific product.

  CTA (added in the 2026-09-09 layout redesign): there is still no unified "write a store
  review" submission flow — every real write-a-review form lives on a product's own page (see
  star_rating.liquid). Rather than fabricate a flow that doesn't exist, the CTA honestly reads
  "Write a Review" and sends a shopper to the storefront's real all-products page
  (`routes.all_products_collection_url`, a URL every Shopify store has) to pick a product to
  review — the same real destination every review is genuinely tied to, not a dead end. If a
  merchant later adds a store-level submission flow, only this one data attribute needs to
  change. Colors/typography/spacing come from the same centralized Appearance System (Brand
  Studio) every other Imagyn widget on this storefront already uses.
{% endcomment %}
<div
  data-imagyn-store-reviews
  data-heading="{{ block.settings.heading }}"
  data-cta-label="{{ block.settings.cta_label }}"
  data-cta-url="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"
  data-max-width="{{ block.settings.max_width }}"
  data-size="{{ block.settings.size }}"
  data-show-rating="{{ block.settings.show_rating }}"
  data-show-distribution="{{ block.settings.show_distribution }}"
  data-show-cta="{{ block.settings.show_cta }}"
  data-show-achievements="{{ block.settings.show_achievements }}"
></div>

<script src="{{ 'imagyn-appearance.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'store-reviews.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Store Reviews",
  "target": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Store Reviews" },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_width",
      "label": "Max width (px)",
      "min": 480,
      "max": 1200,
      "step": 20,
      "default": 1080
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "size",
      "label": "Size",
      "options": [
        { "value": "compact", "label": "Compact" },
        { "value": "standard", "label": "Standard" },
        { "value": "large", "label": "Large" }
      ],
      "default": "standard"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Colors, typography and corner radius come from Brand Studio (Settings > Brand Studio in the app) — this block always matches the rest of your Imagyn widgets automatically."
    },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_rating", "label": "Show overall rating", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_distribution", "label": "Show rating distribution", "default": true },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_cta", "label": "Show \"Write a Review\" button", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "Write-a-review button label", "default": "Write a Review" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_achievements", "label": "Show achievements", "default": true }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
